      "source": [
        "# Abstraction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "io_pMIqix4H0"
      },
      "source": [
        "Entity matching (EM) tries to find same real-world entities from different data sources. In this notebook, we will try to build a POC for EM of HealthCare data."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RaJTp48a4lnz"
      },
      "source": [
        "This is small dataset, it contains many sheets. We try to process data into 2 datasets then we can compare data between 2 datasets together.\n",
        "after that we try to process data and apply classification in our data. The steps would be:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 1**: concatenate data and build 2 dataset **A** and **B**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 2**: Apply Magellan into preprocess data\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 3**: Building a classification model\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 4**: Evaluate model"
      ]
    },
